---
title: Figure 3. DocuTracker Data Flow Diagram - Level 1
config:
  flowchart:
    curve: stepAfter
---
flowchart LR
    E[Employee]:::entity
    R[Reviewer / Signer]:::entity
    A[Administrator]:::entity

    P1((1.0<br/>Manage Documents)):::process
    P2((2.0<br/>Execute Workflow)):::process
    P3((3.0<br/>Authorize Access)):::process
    P4((4.0<br/>Manage Notifications)):::process
    P5((5.0<br/>Configure System)):::process
    P6((6.0<br/>Monitor Escalations)):::process

    D1[(D1 Documents & Contents)]:::store
    D2[(D2 Workflow Configuration)]:::store
    D3[(D3 Routing & History)]:::store
    D4[(D4 Permissions & Users)]:::store
    D5[(D5 Attachments & Signatures)]:::store
    D6[(D6 Notifications)]:::store
    D7[(D7 Escalation Rules)]:::store

    E -->|create, edit, attach, submit| P1
    P1 -->|document and status| E
    R -->|approve, forward, return, reject, sign| P2
    P2 -->|assignment and result| R
    A -->|configuration changes| P5
    P5 -->|saved settings and audit result| A

    P1 <--> D1
    P1 <--> D5
    P1 --> P3
    P2 --> P3
    P2 <--> D2
    P2 <--> D3
    P2 --> P4
    P3 <--> D4
    P4 <--> D6
    P4 --> E
    P4 --> R
    P5 <--> D2
    P5 <--> D4
    P5 <--> D7
    P6 <--> D1
    P6 <--> D7
    P6 --> D3
    P6 --> P4

    classDef entity fill:#fff2cc,stroke:#b8860b,color:#222,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef process fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#111,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef store fill:#ede9fe,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#111,stroke-width:2px;
